  title "The Cleansing"
  summary "Vaulius-phantasm~ recounts how ☽'Sanctteinvaus acquired a powerful grimoire and used it to escort a fire-core shipment through corrupted tunnels to Wane☽ Oncea, defying the merchant ☽'aeteraea who profited from the region's supernatural corruption. The tome's activation triggered a catastrophic cleansing that burned away the wrongness infecting the settlement, destroying ☽'aeteraea's networks and leaving ☽'Sanctteinvaus permanently altered—her frozen flipper locked in the shape of gripping the tome's weight. The grimoire now rests sealed in Wane☽ Oncea, the corruption purged but at the cost of those who carried it."
